hplt-ko-en — Korean → English
================================

Derived from the HPLT project (Horizon Europe grant No 101070350):
  HPLT/translate-ko-en-v2.0-hplt_opus
  https://huggingface.co/HPLT/translate-ko-en-v2.0-hplt_opus
  "An Expanded Massive Multilingual Dataset for High-Performance Language
   Technologies", arXiv:2503.10267

License: CC-BY-4.0 (attribution required). Redistributed under the same license.

Converted here from the native Marian release (model.npz.best-chrf.npz +
model.ko-en.spm) with ctranslate2's Marian converter to int8, because HPLT does
not publish a CTranslate2 build.

config.json sets:
  "decoder_start_token": "<s>"
  "add_source_eos": true
Without both, CTranslate2 output degenerates into repetition loops.
